write-it (1.0.10-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The font face and the font size apply inside a table cell.
  * Table Width sets a column and the whole table, and a column border can be dragged.
  * A heading in a cell has the same space as a heading in the body, and an empty cell shows that face.

 -- Greg Gauthier <gmgauthier@protonmail.com>  Sun, 11 Oct 2026 23:06:16 +0100

write-it (1.0.9-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * A heading after a table styles that paragraph, and a heading inside a cell styles the cell.
  * Bold, italic, and underline apply inside a table cell.
  * A selection clears when the caret is placed somewhere else.
  * Each page is a full sheet, and the page number changes at that sheet.
  * Applying a style leaves the view on the caret.

 -- Greg Gauthier <gmgauthier@protonmail.com>  Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:09:30 +0100

